From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:57:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 180/200] Unified: Japanese for untranslated and inconsistent
 wording found in GUI testing

Assembly isolate modes, TechDraw projection view labels and line type
names, the delete confirmation (question after the list), STEP import
options and code pages, command groups in the keyboard settings, and
consistent terms: the sketch's normal axis, mirror, part/group, skin,
horizontal/vertical length dimensions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
